    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783860/extras/5abd3ccc289bb1ffed4ca0b99af3df6b.poster.avif?t=1736292058\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783860/extras/5abd3ccc289bb1ffed4ca0b99af3df6b.webm?t=1736292058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783860/extras/5abd3ccc289bb1ffed4ca0b99af3df6b.mp4?t=1736292058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2d Metroidvania, Platformer, twin stick shooter, arcade roguelite adventure with meta progression and random boosts. Destroy the crystals blocking your way to freedom and earn new abilities along the way while teleporting between random levels at will. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783860/extras/43c866b1c2e39bac9e753203752c24e4.poster.avif?t=1736292058\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783860/extras/43c866b1c2e39bac9e753203752c24e4.webm?t=1736292058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783860/extras/43c866b1c2e39bac9e753203752c24e4.mp4?t=1736292058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sierra is trapped and abducted by a celestial being with insane powers, unlock the weapons to free them and yourself from this place where everyday is another battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783860/extras/d8a942a2fd32062dc32c7d0ddef533a4.poster.avif?t=1736292058\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783860/extras/d8a942a2fd32062dc32c7d0ddef533a4.webm?t=1736292058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783860/extras/d8a942a2fd32062dc32c7d0ddef533a4.mp4?t=1736292058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A side scrolling shooter with some modern enhancements; Rogue Dimensions is an homage to classic games of the past. You are tasked with breaking the beams that lock away ancient war relics with great power. Use these to break from a prison in time where each level is segmented and can only be traversed by teleporting between them. Destroy enemies, buy upgrades, discover secrets, save the universe, or die and try again. Find Weapons, buy upgrades, destroy enemies, find secrets, and break out of a rogue dimension unlike any other. Every run is another chance at freedom!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783860/extras/5abd3ccc289bb1ffed4ca0b99af3df6b.poster.avif?t=1736292058\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783860/extras/5abd3ccc289bb1ffed4ca0b99af3df6b.webm?t=1736292058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783860/extras/5abd3ccc289bb1ffed4ca0b99af3df6b.mp4?t=1736292058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2d Metroidvania, Platformer, twin stick shooter, arcade roguelite adventure with meta progression and random boosts. Destroy the crystals blocking your way to freedom and earn new abilities along the way while teleporting between random levels at will. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783860/extras/43c866b1c2e39bac9e753203752c24e4.poster.avif?t=1736292058\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783860/extras/43c866b1c2e39bac9e753203752c24e4.webm?t=1736292058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783860/extras/43c866b1c2e39bac9e753203752c24e4.mp4?t=1736292058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sierra is trapped and abducted by a celestial being with insane powers, unlock the weapons to free them and yourself from this place where everyday is another battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783860/extras/d8a942a2fd32062dc32c7d0ddef533a4.poster.avif?t=1736292058\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783860/extras/d8a942a2fd32062dc32c7d0ddef533a4.webm?t=1736292058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783860/extras/d8a942a2fd32062dc32c7d0ddef533a4.mp4?t=1736292058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A side scrolling shooter with some modern enhancements; Rogue Dimensions is an homage to classic games of the past. You are tasked with breaking the beams that lock away ancient war relics with great power. Use these to break from a prison in time where each level is segmented and can only be traversed by teleporting between them. Destroy enemies, buy upgrades, discover secrets, save the universe, or die and try again. Find Weapons, buy upgrades, destroy enemies, find secrets, and break out of a rogue dimension unlike any other. Every run is another chance at freedom!</p>",
